    description: "Per WI-vobiv-kivop investigation 2026-04-26 on cohort cohort-001/iter-001 (deep-20260425-210357), airflow's hg.json contains 3,079 external_symbol nodes whose 'language' slot is the literal string 'rst' (and 450 nodes with names containing '/' or ':'). Likely producer: a Sphinx/RST cross-reference handler emitting :func:`...` references with .rst paths in the dst. Same shape as the original INV-nodij toml_config bug and the Vue analyzer leak (now fixed in PR #3385). Fix paths: (a) locate the producer (grep packages for .rst handling and dst construction sites); (b) decide whether RST should be added to the known-language set with kind='document' or whether the producer should skip emitting boundary-bound edges altogether; (c) add a property test asserting all language slots ∈ known-langs across a synthetic Python+RST repo. Acceptance: airflow's external_symbol language slot count for 'rst' drops to 0 in a future cohort."  # 5428
